  "description": "MicroserviceMonolith is a lightweight modular monolith framework for .NET. It provides modules with lifecycle management, in-memory command and query buses (CQRS), an event bus with sequential, parallel and background dispatch strategies, pipeline middlewares (logging, retry, error handling, performance tracking), a background execution queue, an in-memory outbox reference implementation, and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration.",
